{"pageProps":{"meta":{"id":"obsidian:free-api-image-directory-20261102","title":"免费绘图API怎么选：免密、周期额度和新人试用资料目录","date":"2026-11-03","updated":"2026-11-03","summary":"先看实际原图，再按免费来源选绘图接口。","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-资源分享","name":"资源分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["资源分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-免费API","name":"免费API","color":"default"}],"image":"/obsidian-assets/free-api-image-directory-20261102/cover-b1ccd2dbec.jpg","coverBlockId":null,"slug":"free-api-image-directory-20261102","legacyPaths":[],"lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"article","discoveryName":"免费绘图API怎么选：免密、周期额度和新人试用资料目录","discoveryCategory":null,"discoveryStage":null,"discoveryUrl":null,"source":"markdown","fixedProductFooter":true},"markdownHtml":"<blockquote>\n<p><strong>摘要</strong>\n先看原图，再选免密、周期额度或试用积分\n黑粉科技 · 2026年11月2日资料与实测</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>免费的绘图入口里，既有不用密钥的公共服务，也有注册后按额度生成的接口，还有完成任务换积分的方式。这一篇把已经收集的图片方案分开讲。最先展示两份真正拿到的输出：同样想让机器人浇水，一家画对了主体，另一家返回了人物。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/free-api-image-directory-20261102/image-agnes-result-c3704bc78f.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/d421636da7b03003b3181e81-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/d421636da7b03003b3181e81-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/free-api-image-directory-20261102/image-agnes-result-c3704bc78f.png\" alt=\"Agnes实测原图\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1312\" height=\"736\"></picture></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/free-api-image-directory-20261102/image-pollinations-result-ebd09bb8e8.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/1bd53befdeac35ec2f15d450-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/1bd53befdeac35ec2f15d450-768.webp 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/free-api-image-directory-20261102/image-pollinations-result-ebd09bb8e8.jpg\" alt=\"Pollinations实测返回\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"768\" height=\"768\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>Agnes这次选agnes-image-2.5-flash，1K、16∶9，收到1312×736的PNG，上游完整请求15.688秒。Pollinations Classic收到768×768的JPEG，但内容与机器人浇水的任务不符。第二张图能打开，不等于任务完成。</p>\n<h2>先看已完成的Agnes文生图</h2>\n<p>默认试用档当前对指定Flash图片模型阶段限免，Agent Plan按刊例价折算积分，不能直接套用零价。这次调用前确认了即时零价并禁止付费回退；最终账单未读取。完整接法、参数和原图检查在Agnes实测篇。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/free-api-image-directory-20261102/image-agnes-conditions-dcff4dc1de.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/f18bece3c375ed02a01f20d3-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/f18bece3c375ed02a01f20d3-769.webp 769w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/free-api-image-directory-20261102/image-agnes-conditions-dcff4dc1de.png\" alt=\"Agnes试用条件\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"769\" height=\"394\"></picture></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/free-api-image-directory-20261102/image-agnes-image-price-05b174a8ef.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/5f7244d0b2c3419e31618f81-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/5f7244d0b2c3419e31618f81-769.webp 769w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/free-api-image-directory-20261102/image-agnes-image-price-05b174a8ef.png\" alt=\"Agnes图片型号定价\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"769\" height=\"414\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>官方入口：<a href=\"https://wiki.agnes-ai.com/zh-Hans/docs/agnes-image-25-flash\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://wiki.agnes-ai.com/zh-Hans/docs/agnes-image-25-flash\">图片接口文档</a>；<a href=\"https://wiki.agnes-ai.com/zh-Hans/docs/pricing\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://wiki.agnes-ai.com/zh-Hans/docs/pricing\">定价与试用规则</a>。</p>\n<h2>其余绘图入口，按免费来源分开选</h2>\n<h3>CogView-3-Flash 免费绘图（待实测）</h3>\n<p>**周期免费／指定零价。**官方定价表列为免费；本期未取得统一次数上限。</p>\n<p>需要自己的密钥；核对当前模型开放状态、限流和分辨率。</p>\n<p>本版记录的型号：cogview-3-flash。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-接口基础地址\">https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/paas/v4\n</code></pre>\n<p>官方入口：<a href=\"https://docs.bigmodel.cn/cn/guide/start/pricing.md\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://docs.bigmodel.cn/cn/guide/start/pricing.md\">查看资料1</a>；<a href=\"https://docs.bigmodel.cn/cn/guide/models/free/cogview-3-flash\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://docs.bigmodel.cn/cn/guide/models/free/cogview-3-flash\">查看资料2</a>。</p>\n<h3>魔搭 API-Inference（待实测）</h3>\n<p>**周期免费／指定零价。**官方设有免费推理；历史官方公告写每日2000次，当前分模态限额页为动态页面，本期未完整取得。</p>\n<p>使用自己的访问令牌，只选带 API-Inference 服务的模型；模型仓库存在不代表开放接口。</p>\n<p>这一项同时包含文字和图片，本文只把它放进绘图资料目录，并未测出图片结果。</p>\n<p>官方入口：<a href=\"https://www.modelscope.cn/docs/model-service/API-Inference/limits\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://www.modelscope.cn/docs/model-service/API-Inference/limits\">查看资料1</a>；<a href=\"https://www.modelscope.cn/headlines/article/795\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://www.modelscope.cn/headlines/article/795\">查看资料2</a>。</p>\n<h3>Cloudflare 绘图（待实测）</h3>\n<p>**周期免费／指定零价。**每天共享10000 Neurons；不是10000次，也不是10000个Token。</p>\n<p>同一账户多模态共同消耗；Workers Free超额停止，Workers Paid超额计费；部分前沿型号可能另需预付费。</p>\n<p>本版记录的型号：@cf/lykon/dreamshaper-8-lcm。</p>\n<p>官方入口：<a href=\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/platform/pricing/\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/platform/pricing/\">查看资料1</a>；<a href=\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/models/dreamshaper-8-lcm/\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/models/dreamshaper-8-lcm/\">查看资料2</a>。</p>\n<h3>Pollinations Classic 绘图</h3>\n<p>**免密限流。**免注册；同IP串行，图片至少间隔45秒；面积最多768×768，JPEG带小标志。</p>\n<p>内容可能被过滤；适合轻量原型，不能当稳定批量生产服务。</p>\n<p>测试进度：已返回768×768图片，主体与任务不符。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-接口基础地址\">https://image.pollinations.ai\n</code></pre>\n<p>官方入口：<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pollinations/pollinations/master/APIDOCS.md\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pollinations/pollinations/master/APIDOCS.md\">查看资料</a>。</p>\n<h3>Pollinations 任务积分绘图（待实测）</h3>\n<p>**任务／贡献换积分。**完成任务获得Pollen；兑换额度依任务，积分购买价不等于免费。</p>\n<p>需自己的Key；仅选择当前模型目录paid_only=false且账户免费余额可抵扣的型号。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-接口基础地址\">https://gen.pollinations.ai\n</code></pre>\n<p>官方入口：<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pollinations/pollinations/master/APIDOCS.md\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pollinations/pollinations/master/APIDOCS.md\">查看资料1</a>；<a href=\"https://gen.pollinations.ai/models\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://gen.pollinations.ai/models\">查看资料2</a>。</p>\n<h3>AI Horde 志愿者共享队列（待实测）</h3>\n<p>**社区共享队列。**志愿者共享算力，免费文字和图像任务；队列与优先级随供给变化。</p>\n<p>用正式公开API；贡献和kudos影响优先级；不能承诺固定等待时间或商用授权。</p>\n<p>官方入口：<a href=\"https://aihorde.net/\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://aihorde.net/\">查看资料1</a>；<a href=\"https://aihorde.net/api/\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://aihorde.net/api/\">查看资料2</a>。</p>\n<h3>Stability API新人积分（待实测）</h3>\n<p>**一次性新人试用。**25免费credits；1credit=0.01美元。</p>\n<p>一次性试用；具体图像或Stable Audio型号能否抵扣、消耗量与权限须逐项确认。</p>\n<p>官方入口：<a href=\"https://platform.stability.ai/pricing\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://platform.stability.ai/pricing\">查看资料1</a>；<a href=\"https://platform.stability.ai/docs/getting-started\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://platform.stability.ai/docs/getting-started\">查看资料2</a>。</p>\n<h3>WaveSpeed 图片与视频试用（待实测）</h3>\n<p>**一次性新人试用。**符合条件的新账户1美元免费积分，无需信用卡。</p>\n<p>部分高价型号不允许试用积分；能生成多少由型号、时长、清晰度决定。</p>\n<p>官方入口：<a href=\"https://wavespeed.ai/pricing\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://wavespeed.ai/pricing\">查看资料</a>。</p>\n<h2>图片接口和聊天接口，要分开接</h2>\n<p>看图回答是把已有图片交给模型理解，文生图是产出新图片；后者还可能走异步任务。平台支持图片上传，不能直接推出它有免费绘图。接入黑粉盒子时，文字、图片、视频分别登记能力与测试状态，不能用一个“可用”开关包住全部。</p>\n<p>生成结果先下载原文件，检查格式、尺寸、任务对象和动作；只拿临时网址作收藏，链接失效后连样图也看不到。需要排队的服务还要保存任务号，稍后查原任务，避免超时后重复提交多张图。</p>\n<p>商业使用再查该服务和具体模型的许可。免费描述的是当次调用成本，不能自动推导素材可以用于一切商业场景。本版尚未逐项核完商用许可。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>引用：我的判断</strong>\n优先从已有原图的Agnes实测入手；免密入口可以做轻量验证，但这次Pollinations返回与任务不符，暂不放进成功推荐。其余按免费类型留好入口，补到真正生成的结果后，再安排各自的详细实测篇。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>主要查证来源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://wiki.agnes-ai.com/zh-Hans/docs/agnes-image-25-flash\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://wiki.agnes-ai.com/zh-Hans/docs/agnes-image-25-flash\">Agnes Image 2.5 Flash 官方文档</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wiki.agnes-ai.com/zh-Hans/docs/pricing\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://wiki.agnes-ai.com/zh-Hans/docs/pricing\">Agnes 官方定价与试用计费</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.bigmodel.cn/cn/guide/start/pricing.md\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://docs.bigmodel.cn/cn/guide/start/pricing.md\">CogView-3-Flash 免费绘图</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.bigmodel.cn/cn/guide/models/free/cogview-3-flash\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://docs.bigmodel.cn/cn/guide/models/free/cogview-3-flash\">CogView-3-Flash 免费绘图</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.modelscope.cn/docs/model-service/API-Inference/limits\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://www.modelscope.cn/docs/model-service/API-Inference/limits\">魔搭 API-Inference</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.modelscope.cn/headlines/article/795\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://www.modelscope.cn/headlines/article/795\">魔搭 API-Inference</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/platform/pricing/\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/platform/pricing/\">Cloudflare 绘图</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/models/dreamshaper-8-lcm/\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/models/dreamshaper-8-lcm/\">Cloudflare 绘图</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pollinations/pollinations/master/APIDOCS.md\" class=\"resource-link\" tar